  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "爲了疲乏的緣故，我點了一隻紙菸。",
      "output_sha256": "f05cfc8681597877257f1c36b00b5f3e293de9a46ddc8a628c703fa8f46e358a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "f05cfc8681597877257f1c36b00b5f3e293de9a46ddc8a628c703fa8f46e358a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "綠色的星星，藍色的天空，紅色的屋頂，黑色的蝙蝠，灰色的小蛾，窗子正好開在這些景象之間，而我的床就靠在窗旁，手指舉著紙菸的影子映在窗下。",
      "output_sha256": "e824bf829288d3180254302f434135bd3d635e8efa3cac29d8db8fe86f62535a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.639452,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f89c6901ce0faabe63d28df0db28b118b1b16f43b9d020b8c955c19d8fd675f3",
        "6719d42f30797cf0f6f6312ec929ee21b461a082ab4d0a097d90cf67563c0fa8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e824bf829288d3180254302f434135bd3d635e8efa3cac29d8db8fe86f62535a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我看一看錶，我還是睡得這麼樣的早，才九點鐘剛過了。",
      "output_sha256": "bee669ce576281d8f1605b1179e961a55834cc860464c1cd6a274daf6c7fa65a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "bee669ce576281d8f1605b1179e961a55834cc860464c1cd6a274daf6c7fa65a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "心中有些煩悶，但又無法明確說出這份煩惱，彷彿是喝酒後的情緒，卻實際上我並沒有喝酒。",
      "output_sha256": "ba3dd9aedc694bcc58350ee55100da9ed5b43692bf6c136aeed997dbcd8151dc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.391172,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0fe3257f20cfa1fc7c5383468ced73ce7d68e29fa43792e95649a7d371894362"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ba3dd9aedc694bcc58350ee55100da9ed5b43692bf6c136aeed997dbcd8151dc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "也許這又是想家了吧!",
      "output_sha256": "ca46b17129b77beb8d0d1ef2c317af3f9e9ebe2f496ce043a56652565608f5c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "ca46b17129b77beb8d0d1ef2c317af3f9e9ebe2f496ce043a56652565608f5c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不，不能說是想家，應該說所思念的是鄉土。",
      "output_sha256": "dcc2048b7f553b9f46d6cd9aed652aca28246a623c662fb971721fe85536a781",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "dcc2048b7f553b9f46d6cd9aed652aca28246a623c662fb971721fe85536a781",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "人們所思念着的那麼廣大的天地，而引起這思念來的，往往是幾片樹林，兩三座家屋，或是一個人物……也或者只憑着一點鐘的記憶，記憶着那已經過去的，曾經活動過的事物的痕跡。",
      "output_sha256": "c3cca1d4e86567f0dba02d007a8af44a2101c49886465c9965639ba211af4992",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "c3cca1d4e86567f0dba02d007a8af44a2101c49886465c9965639ba211af4992",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這幾天來，似乎心情更加閒逸，平常不太在意的事情，現在卻開始想起，因此和軍一談就聊到了深夜。",
      "output_sha256": "a9db6dc654dd869d93a272cc2536917c11331f5df35e3df0a3935e4501b58b8e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.439783,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fd29da205e16e2d409afe8c84d8635a6ff08caabf67784de437fa2c985d21bb9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a9db6dc654dd869d93a272cc2536917c11331f5df35e3df0a3935e4501b58b8e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而每談過之後，就總有些空寞之感，就好像喝過酒之後，那種空寞。",
      "output_sha256": "f87c31c1fb2181fd74b16ba324f986bf7d3ec50c91aba00d7acecca9bab1de83",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "f87c31c1fb2181fd74b16ba324f986bf7d3ec50c91aba00d7acecca9bab1de83",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "雖然有時仍就聽着炮聲，且或看到了戰地的火光，但我們的閒談，仍舊是閒談。",
      "output_sha256": "6ca91a42ee48367e9d1dbad3921d73a18f973022a52d27e5082b5374191baa89",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "6ca91a42ee48367e9d1dbad3921d73a18f973022a52d27e5082b5374191baa89",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“渥特克(很辣的酒)還有吧!",
      "output_sha256": "61198981578034302499407d52555b8e98521d89813d4a047e4f8907e0eb675d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "61198981578034302499407d52555b8e98521d89813d4a047e4f8907e0eb675d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "喝一點!”",
      "output_sha256": "9181e8bfd94f1d33bcd920933dd204511212867daae7d6cb531590e985f518a0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "9181e8bfd94f1d33bcd920933dd204511212867daae7d6cb531590e985f518a0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他在椅子上搖著說。",
      "output_sha256": "d848a9381fc815ebe3b8656448f5045ee9e24f66ba967a5f967c593027f4364a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.670425,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d01f4c8c5bd4c9a69592189b03995f2f8b7fafcc38ed33269907ceaceb6ae8a2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d848a9381fc815ebe3b8656448f5045ee9e24f66ba967a5f967c593027f4364a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "爲了消磨時間，我在走廊上抄寫這幾年來所寫的詩句和短文。",
      "output_sha256": "5ee9475a32c4a7e860997109ac446663130655ed57065626f28fa6328d43c49d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.436309,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f46aec0d792ef70f1ea3c26e393e122760765f5455a2e60a3f29a23dba8c9a66"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5ee9475a32c4a7e860997109ac446663130655ed57065626f28fa6328d43c49d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而且抄着，而且讀着，覺得很可笑，不相信這就是自己寫下來的了。",
      "output_sha256": "ee62ed3e865a6f44e402acfdbd78a4b7b49b6d5b0bb0fed85957cde6185fe67d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "ee62ed3e865a6f44e402acfdbd78a4b7b49b6d5b0bb0fed85957cde6185fe67d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "抄完之後，我隨意翻閱舊冊子，那是軍所編輯的，除了他為我剪貼的一小部分，其餘全是他的，偶爾還有他的朋友的作品。",
      "output_sha256": "f2379d3327291d8366f4fc3c9fd087c4db828c974ea2f45112f79b01e7773f2e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.526865,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2d58997cf6166600f19d962b56be07d137681be3831338936e1ddd400d1b8a82"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f2379d3327291d8366f4fc3c9fd087c4db828c974ea2f45112f79b01e7773f2e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "於是我就讀着他的朋友用紫色墨水寫成的詩句，因爲是古詩，那文句，就有些不解之處，於是請教於軍，他就和我一起讀起來了。",
      "output_sha256": "2eb290dff70f9d365f48a602fa0150ddd8373a7b530672999c6050494fa7ebc3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "2eb290dff70f9d365f48a602fa0150ddd8373a7b530672999c6050494fa7ebc3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他讀舊詩，本來有個奇怪的韻調，起初，這是我所不喜歡的，可是這兩年來，我就學着他，並且我自己聽來已經和他一腔一調。",
      "output_sha256": "fecc6be19b1f03ad742bfaa77127d2a5a85124bfec51bf31ac2d6d0945c513fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "fecc6be19b1f03ad742bfaa77127d2a5a85124bfec51bf31ac2d6d0945c513fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我常常是這樣，比方我最反對他正在唱着歌的時候，我真想把耳朵塞了起來，有時因爲禁止而禁止不住他，竟要真的生氣，但是又一想，自己從什麼地方得來的這種權力呢?",
      "output_sha256": "2d0e31c8d61f9b67c96cf233a83fff5b472ec61b66d4e3fc28e659654a6e2f0f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "2d0e31c8d61f9b67c96cf233a83fff5b472ec61b66d4e3fc28e659654a6e2f0f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "於是只好隨他唱，這歌一經唱得久了!",
      "output_sha256": "3df2732d14cb7720d556b1a70b7d71ca5d776921e607db3236f63a49542c4cf2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "3df2732d14cb7720d556b1a70b7d71ca5d776921e607db3236f63a49542c4cf2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我也就和他一齊唱了，並且不知不覺之間自己也常常一方面燒着飯，一方面哼着。",
      "output_sha256": "1381c918b84d31a50cb1dcf6f12842103dcc26fa54ac9e1eea6251a2ef02fb95",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "1381c918b84d31a50cb1dcf6f12842103dcc26fa54ac9e1eea6251a2ef02fb95",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這些用紫色墨水寫成的詩句，我也跟著他用同樣的怪調在走廊上朗讀。",
      "output_sha256": "f98cf21203b59b2da46270d893b7ddc9d9e18f4e63e654f0a88cab20d8169ba0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.664092,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5c1b711d6bcaefe7a6dc6f1666664119a91243a2be83add9f19e32c94674f944"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f98cf21203b59b2da46270d893b7ddc9d9e18f4e63e654f0a88cab20d8169ba0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我們的身邊飛來了小蛾的時候，他向我說，他要喝一點酒。",
      "output_sha256": "b63001a4d2a8c0c220b53d6b1d0c3bb099a6fc323f0e5416629ac26d3cc6dec5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "b63001a4d2a8c0c220b53d6b1d0c3bb099a6fc323f0e5416629ac26d3cc6dec5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "本來就在本身之內起着喝過了酒的感覺，我想一定不應該喝了：",
      "output_sha256": "5dee6b3fb5ae297d93c8863c89751943a83d67c4cd213f934e31bd1f0ebe67ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "5dee6b3fb5ae297d93c8863c89751943a83d67c4cd213f934e31bd1f0ebe67ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“喝酒要人多喝，喝完了說說笑笑也就不醉，一個人喝不好，越喝越無聊。”",
      "output_sha256": "dad3827d7a7ad20a6ec037b73056417142aec704e49d21a39659bf523ad4e647",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "dad3827d7a7ad20a6ec037b73056417142aec704e49d21a39659bf523ad4e647",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“我恰恰相反，喜歡獨飲獨酌……”",
      "output_sha256": "0cfc728d9f96eddb27ed72094433f8fe0268177e6456b761af78316c1a7b58f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.594341,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9aded5eadd934e5556992145f382b79689b54695c09a7a406d062996920b1fb8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0cfc728d9f96eddb27ed72094433f8fe0268177e6456b761af78316c1a7b58f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "隨後我說“渥特克”酒沒有了。",
      "output_sha256": "447454760b776ced0431d6f77e338be757a0519f09fb1044fadfe7ba3597959b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.879545,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6102d2f8888fc9f3652565d0bebcf2091e1348c25019209aeee6b2b09721fca1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "447454760b776ced0431d6f77e338be757a0519f09fb1044fadfe7ba3597959b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "(其實是有的，就在我腳邊的小箱子裏。)",
      "output_sha256": "cbc2f640c6db150c169da54f7c0757311244cd8fe3a69463de193f8716739532",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "cbc2f640c6db150c169da54f7c0757311244cd8fe3a69463de193f8716739532",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“朋友們，坐牢的……留在滿洲的，為了‘剿匪’而死的……作這詩的人，聽說就在南京的‘反省院’裡。”",
      "output_sha256": "c1f4fae06fd00ebda79aa47a08827cddea58264acbd4e80ecc53e651edfabdd5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.813877,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9c09e13b6449d0da688c5bb7a4df59585c182755fb796d1a157e5c2d90ebe95f"
