      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“你爲什麼走的這一條路呢?",
      "output_sha256": "c1c10bc7a3242e3e235d56b5f8aadf56ecab091ba4fdf46e594c2b18d5131640",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "c1c10bc7a3242e3e235d56b5f8aadf56ecab091ba4fdf46e594c2b18d5131640",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "照理說，不可能，”因爲他是軍官學生。",
      "output_sha256": "db1484720d105edc024b7642a2d7c51fcbc3191992deadf767966f59e8d745ae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "db1484720d105edc024b7642a2d7c51fcbc3191992deadf767966f59e8d745ae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想：“就是因爲你有這樣的幾個朋友……很難，一個人的成長，就差在一點點上……”我常常把人生看得很可怕。",
      "output_sha256": "0af3c33a86de86fb0c4a1aced161da4e47cb5d804b6892bb15edbf832f68058e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "0af3c33a86de86fb0c4a1aced161da4e47cb5d804b6892bb15edbf832f68058e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“嗯!",
      "output_sha256": "9daac60d0fac8e5ba0ef0730362ebd91a58a55f21eafa949f0c59cc04c843686",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "9daac60d0fac8e5ba0ef0730362ebd91a58a55f21eafa949f0c59cc04c843686",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "是的……”他的目光沿著走廊一直望去，我明白，他的情感一定延伸得很遠。",
      "output_sha256": "88fc8d427a90b8dffffe671e23fee4683f576cc272dc02aeb164175771e6c66c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.627011,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d698ca97e2eed416a202934ad36072225ac8748a225c10b1a0aae437030c5a8b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "88fc8d427a90b8dffffe671e23fee4683f576cc272dc02aeb164175771e6c66c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這思念朋友的心情，我也常有。",
      "output_sha256": "c9d0929a432e03fd24ef84a2ba99ee33b277111664854848b632f7bef2f00b69",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "c9d0929a432e03fd24ef84a2ba99ee33b277111664854848b632f7bef2f00b69",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一做了女人，便沒有朋友。",
      "output_sha256": "eda7a2da8f2b8ea1955b300abcc8c17c422bb7977e6660db019401532904f9fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "eda7a2da8f2b8ea1955b300abcc8c17c422bb7977e6660db019401532904f9fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但我還有三五個，在滿洲的在滿洲，嫁了丈夫的，娶了妻子的，爲了生活而忙着的，比方前兩天就有一個朋友經過上海而到北方戰地去。",
      "output_sha256": "7974aadcd55370cd51eba909862ead4c3cd7405c17c49f02983fc321059d7ad8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "7974aadcd55370cd51eba909862ead4c3cd7405c17c49f02983fc321059d7ad8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他說：“朋友們別開，生死莫測。”",
      "output_sha256": "d1bda5a3824856c77b70e809c46837ca9f1dd4510974af83c123a83fd9ef49bf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "d1bda5a3824856c77b70e809c46837ca9f1dd4510974af83c123a83fd9ef49bf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我回答：“這些話還行嗎？",
      "output_sha256": "c7d3b6e45d8acdb028e4b5241122f7b2ac054ff73aeb674f0a21707e3f2aa77e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.594231,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e945543618750bbff423d671b40b3fc53e1bf1df046fa5b0fd33fcb9312d1501"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c7d3b6e45d8acdb028e4b5241122f7b2ac054ff73aeb674f0a21707e3f2aa77e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "哪裏有的事情?”",
      "output_sha256": "2d696b9fb803b6ad160aceb059809e3c1dcc5f652c97d87d296679cde1a228d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "2d696b9fb803b6ad160aceb059809e3c1dcc5f652c97d87d296679cde1a228d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他站在人行道上高高舉起手臂。",
      "output_sha256": "ac09f8e87261433a93e120a58fb716200c6203721cf3eab35f7a5cedd60acfd7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.672118,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0ad4ca153f43017bd2a4b29934bcbb49406c400b75dc44a2096edd7c3334f142"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ac09f8e87261433a93e120a58fb716200c6203721cf3eab35f7a5cedd60acfd7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我心中想，朋友們別開，我也不知道該怎麼辦！",
      "output_sha256": "0ad7956f1dd4dc1a61b6d0eb86e778c5ea99c0ce1c476c78bda6c4627802a295",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.738485,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8a6b33191b9dad45220345562c25016caf8b60167a40b5886736bfd681994867"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0ad7956f1dd4dc1a61b6d0eb86e778c5ea99c0ce1c476c78bda6c4627802a295",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一些飛來的小蛾，它們每個都披着銀粉，我一個個地細細地考查着那翅子上的紋痕。",
      "output_sha256": "5cbea26644e88f4ab81d852a97ec493dfb1ea4450c31feac4580f803e944b367",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "5cbea26644e88f4ab81d852a97ec493dfb1ea4450c31feac4580f803e944b367",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這類似詩的東西，我就這樣把它抄完了。",
      "output_sha256": "2174f84b31e32947cf6422699a5049b11cc47cfe20081089b7db76a96383addb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "2174f84b31e32947cf6422699a5049b11cc47cfe20081089b7db76a96383addb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 30,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "躺在床上，看了看錶，才剛過九點，於是我一邊看著手指舉著的紙菸映在牆上，一邊思索著這場戰爭，以及詩集出版的問題。",
      "output_sha256": "ad42885020d6284033aaa0f46bb6926f938000e344381aa5918060463664d8d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.563725,
